1
00:00:00,529 --> 00:00:02,699
(Penny:)How come we can't think
of something we both want to do?

2
00:00:02,698 --> 00:00:05,028
(Amy:)Because you always
pick what we do

3
00:00:05,034 --> 00:00:06,534
(Amy:)and I just
go along with it.

4
00:00:06,535 --> 00:00:07,765
(Leonard:)Ah, interesting--

5
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:09,770
(Leonard:)we're being accused of
making you do things

6
00:00:09,772 --> 00:00:11,272
(Leonard:)you don't like,
and here you are,

7
00:00:11,274 --> 00:00:12,874
(Leonard:)doing the same
thing to poor Amy.

8
00:00:12,875 --> 00:00:15,475
(Sheldon:)You should point out
the hypocrisy of that.

9
00:00:19,382 --> 00:00:20,782
(Leonard:)That's what I was doing.

10
00:00:21,917 --> 00:00:24,617
(Sheldon:)Oh, that wasn't clear.

11
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:26,550
(Sheldon:)Try it again, but this time
drive it home

12
00:00:26,555 --> 00:00:29,895
with, "How do you like
them apples, missy?"

13
00:00:29,892 --> 00:00:31,722
(Penny:)All right,
keep thinking.

14
00:00:31,727 --> 00:00:33,927
(Sheldon:)You're making it
too complicated.

15
00:00:33,929 --> 00:00:34,959
(Sheldon:)Why not stick
to the basics?

16
00:00:34,964 --> 00:00:36,594
(Sheldon:)Go shopping for clothes

17
00:00:36,599 --> 00:00:38,069
(Sheldon:)while Leonard and I sit in those

18
00:00:38,067 --> 00:00:40,637
(Sheldon:)uncomfortable chairs
and hold your purses, hmm?

19
00:00:40,636 --> 00:00:41,936
(Sheldon:)I know I'd hate that.

20
00:00:41,937 --> 00:00:42,937
(Sheldon:)Leonard?

21
00:00:42,938 --> 00:00:45,408
(Leonard:)Well, yeah.

22
00:00:45,408 --> 00:00:48,578
(Sheldon:)Well, then, it's settled?

23
00:00:48,577 --> 00:00:50,577
(Amy:)What do you say?
Sounds kind of perfect.

24
00:00:50,579 --> 00:00:52,079
(Penny:)It does-- somehow he managed

25
00:00:52,081 --> 00:00:54,781
(Penny:)to take all the fun out of it.

26
00:00:54,784 --> 00:00:59,024
(Sheldon:)Well, once again,
it's what I do.

